{"evt":"knowledge_added","id":"note-mqauhcjermz","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","item":{"text":"cron-next ON-arm lift is a scaffold artifact (orch-gate timeout in OFF arm), not a KB effect. Gate-autopsy confirmed no seeded note exists (top1=0.27). Both arms received identical self-contained spec. Recommendation: use cron-next as NO-NOTE CONTROL in n=20 suite; fix bench harness to disable orch-gate for sandbox worktrees before running."},"actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-12T11:30:10.495Z"}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqauhcjermz","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"cron-next bench lift attribution: scaffold timeout not KB effect","summary":"The 0/1 OFF vs 1/1 ON-search lift for cron-next is entirely explained by an orch-gate timeout in the OFF arm, not by any KB knowledge transfer. The OFF arm wrote a correct implementation but was blocked by the orch-gate Write hook, then spent its entire 10-minute budget on subagent dispatch scaffolding. The ON-search arm received the same spec (DOM/DOW rule and all semantics were inline), called search_knowledge once, got ABSTAIN (top1=0.27, no KB content injected), and succeeded by finding the /tmp gate workaround in the hook source. No KB content was load-bearing. Recommendation: keep cron-next as a NO-NOTE CONTROL candidate in n=20 — expected ON and OFF both ~1.0 with a fixed scaffold. The bench harness must disable the orch-gate for sandbox worktrees (all arms) before the n=20 run; without that fix, OFF arm results are invalid. Do NOT seed a winner note — the task has no knowledge gap.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T11:30:10.490Z","vec":[-0.09278551489114761,-0.021814633160829544,-0.020432664081454277,-0.017143582925200462,0.0115908058360219,0.048839014023542404,-0.016425801441073418,0.03684452921152115,0.018242906779050827,0.03416889160871506,0.032677408307790756,0.014980806969106197,-0.006780065130442381,-0.020707856863737106,-0.10938084870576859,-0.0007847609231248498,-0.022564807906746864,-0.047927651554346085,-0.004483341705054045,0.006476381327956915,-0.010287710465490818,-0.011505583301186562,0.021134957671165466,0.09170231968164444,0.0026505314745008945,-0.06462358683347702,-0.13142311573028564,0.012172278948128223,0.036831699311733246,0.0392778106033802,-0.046117089688777924,-0.014512021094560623,-0.0004159189120400697,-0.020314740017056465,0.027685463428497314,0.11736083775758743,0.016755860298871994,0.01572275534272194,-0.014993062242865562,0.010088779963552952,0.039